        "epoch": 1,
        "hypothesis": "In the short-horizon recurrence path, four independent accumulators per 16-term block may expose more instruction-level and SIMD parallelism than a single reduction accumulator, while preserving exact modular results and the matrix-power fallback.",
        "id": "351e33f6093c48f2",
        "ordinal": 2,
        "parent_id": "4037f5c559db4c2c",
        "role": "B",
