          ],
          "retained": [
            "Extend the direct recurrence dispatch to distances up to max(64, 8*n), using the duplicated circular window, reversed weights, and 16-term modular-reduction blocks.",
            "Defer matrix initialization and construction until the direct recurrence path is not selected.",
            "Use a shared matrix multiplication kernel that transposes the right operand in 32-by-32 tiles, reduces every eight products, and parallelizes output rows statically for n >= 64."
          ]
        },
